<section class="marquee-section">
    <div class="container container-95">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12">
                <div class="marquee-outer-wrap">
                    <div class="str1 str_wrap wcag-ticker" role="region" aria-label="News ticker">
                        <button type="button" class="wcag-ticker-btn" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause news ticker">
                            <span class="wcag-ticker-btn-pause" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        </button>
                        <div class="wcag-ticker-viewport">
                            <div class="wcag-ticker-track">
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">01</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;"><font color="#7030a0" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Dear Valued Customer, if there is any change in your mobile number, kindly contact your Home Branch immediately. Regards, Cosmos Bank.</b></font></span></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">02</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><a href='https://www.cosmos.bank.in/auth/writereaddata/Files/Notice%20Board%20Display%20Time%20norms.pdf'><h6><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;"><font color="#7030a0" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">‘ Time Norms for Banking Transactions.’</b></font></span></h6></a></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">03</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><font color="#000000"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><b>INFORMATION RELATING TO EXCHANGE RATES, CHARGES, DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS AND OTHER APPLICABLE TERMS AND CONDITIONS FOR CROSS-BORDER FOREIGN EXCHANGE TRANSACTIONS AND SERVICES OF MEMBER BANKS IS AVAILABLE ON THE WEBSITE OF THE FOREIGN EXCHANGE DEALERS’ ASSOCIATION OF INDIA (FEDAI). CUSTOMERS MAY ACCESS THE RELEVANT INFORMATION THROUGH THE MEMBER BANKS INFORMATION HUB </b><a href="https://www.fedai.org.in/InnerPageContent.aspx?Cid=19&SCid=0&SSCid=0&utm_source=chatgpt.com" style="font-weight: bold;">THE MEMBER BANKS INFORMATION HUB</a></span></font></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">04</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><a href='https://www.cosmos.bank.in/product-services-details?id=30'><h6><font color="#000000"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><b> Existing Mobile Banking application “Cosmos GenZ” has now been discontinued from 01 September 2026. Download New “Cosmos Bank MobileBanking” application from Google Play Store/ Apple App store </b></span></font></h6></a></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">05</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><font color="#000000"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><b>Dear Customer, TDS Certificates for Q1 of FY 2026-27 are available at branches. We request you to collect the same from your nearest branch. Regards, Cosmos Bank.</b></span></font></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">06</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><font color="#000000"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><b>As per RBI/TRAI guidelines, Cosmos Bank has registered the phone number 1600312234 for outbound calls related to financial transactions. Kindly save this number to avoid call rejection.

</b></span></font></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">07</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;"><font color="#7030a0" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Complete Your KYC and Keep Your Banking Safe</b></font></span></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">08</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;"><font color="#7030a0" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">One KYC, Multiple Benefits – Use CKYCR Facility</b></font></span></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">09</div>
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-content"><h6><span style="color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12px;"><font color="#7030a0" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Safe Banking Starts with Proper KYC</b></font></span></h6></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="marquee-pointer-div">
                                        <div class="marquee-pointer-number">10</div>
